  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>Lithium Winding Machine</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/08/Industrial-2-Links-to-Industrial-Main.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<p>Features:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Computer-controlled machine setup</li>\n<li>Unified, integrated operator interface</li>\n<li>Integrated with extrusion press</li>\n<li>Easy foil threading</li>\n<li>Automated winding cycle</li>\n<li>Controlled wind-to- length</li>\n<li>Electronic tension control</li>\n<li>Web break detection</li>\n<li>Inline thickness measurement option</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Accudyne Systems works closely with&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://lithiuminnovations.com/\">Lithium Innovations</a></strong>,&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://scdryair.com/\">SCDRYAIR</a></strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://trinksinc.com/lithium-extruder/\">Trinks</a></strong>&nbsp;to bring you a complete Lithium Foil processing solution from Extrusion to Foil inlay and windup.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Industrial Automation</h3><ul><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/industrial-automation/lithium-winding-machine/\">Lithium Winding Machine</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/lithiumcopper-laminator/\">Lithium/Copper Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/automated-end-capper/\">Automated End Capper</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/biological-assay/\">Biological Assay</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/cargo-lifter/\">Cargo Lifter</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/foam-cutting/\">Foam Cutting</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/instrumented-fetal-model/\">Instrumented Fetal Model</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/spray-booth/\">Spray Booth</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/window-cell-manufacture/\">Window Cell Manufacture</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/hail-stone-machines/\">Hail Stone Machines</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/IA-Lithium-Winder-a.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/IA-Lithium-Winder-a-300x235.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"235\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/IA-Lithium-Winder-b.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/IA-Lithium-Winder-b-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>"
